      "message": "Once `ProviderType` has mutable and frozen forms, this can use `ProviderType::from_value(...)`, which returns `Either\u003c\u0026ProviderType\u003c\u0027v\u003e, \u0026FrozenProviderType\u003e`, just like `RecordType`.\n\nA few small `ty_id()`, `configured()`, and `fields()` helpers can hide the dispatch from the rest of this file.",
      "revId": "530087918c62b12600b751e9575d1498dc2dd75c",
      "serverId": "c360c8e5-7aa8-3905-a7a0-810934766dac"
