        "id": 1002137
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-07-15T09:38:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With that representation split, `export_as` can delegate to a small `ProviderCell::get_or_init` helper: the mutable implementation initializes the unsynchronized `OnceCell` once, and the frozen implementation simply returns `Ok(())`.\n\nThat preserves the first name and makes aliases no-ops without `UnsafeCell`, module IDs, or manual `Send`/`Sync`.",
      "revId": "530087918c62b12600b751e9575d1498dc2dd75c",
      "serverId": "c360c8e5-7aa8-3905-a7a0-810934766dac"
    },
