      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-07-15T09:38:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`Freeze` can consume `self.data.into_inner()` into the frozen `Option\u003cProviderTypeData\u003e`. An unexported provider freezes as `None` and remains unusable; an exported one becomes immutable metadata.\n\nThis makes the concurrency invariant structural rather than inferred from module identity.",
      "revId": "530087918c62b12600b751e9575d1498dc2dd75c",
